	'g_label' => 'The cash gap',
	'g_p1' => 'Maren\'s delivery was signed on Monday morning, and the €8,600 invoice was issued on standard 45-day terms. The customer is established and reliable, but new reels of board must be ordered and paid for by Friday to keep the workshop running. Waiting six weeks for earned money forces an artificial halt on production, tying up working capital while overheads, wages, and raw materials remain due immediately.',
