	'h_h1' => 'Paid *Today* For|Last Week\'s Invoice',
	'h_lede' => 'You completed the production and delivered the goods on time. Instead of waiting thirty, forty-five, or sixty days for your business customer to pay, advance ninety percent of the invoice value to your bank account the next working day. We fund B2B invoices between €1,000 and €150,000 with a clear single fee.',
